# Copy to .gitignore at CP0 and commit it before the first worktree is cut.

# Coordination files: one physical copy in the main checkout, never on a branch.
# Worktrees get only tracked files, so these files physically do not exist in any worktree;
# every session reads and appends them in $MAIN by absolute path.
# The Lead exports snapshots to docs/coordination/ at each checkpoint for the history.
/COORDINATION.md
/DECISIONS.md
/STATUS.md
/GLOSSARY.md
/CONTRACT.md

# Worktrees, if they are placed inside the repository.
/.worktrees/

# Secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Line ledgers (each line's progress file) and local scratch.
/.ledger/
/scratch/

# Raw recordings that are too large or private to commit; committed recordings live elsewhere.
# /runs/
